\pard\li360\sa0\sl180\slmult1\f1\fs15\cf0 /**\par
\pard\li360\sa0\sl180\slmult1\f1\fs15\cf0  * Keep the street visualization palette local to its dashboard module so the\par
\pard\li360\sa0\sl180\slmult1\f1\fs15\cf0  * requested factory-returnable shade does not unexpectedly recolor unrelated\par
\pard\li360\sa0\sl180\slmult1\f1\fs15\cf0  * charts that use the shared category definitions.\par
\pard\li360\sa0\sl180\slmult1\f1\fs15\cf0  */\par
\pard\li360\sa0\sl180\slmult1\f1\fs15\cf0 function getWasteStreetCategoryDefinitions()\par
\pard\li360\sa0\sl180\slmult1\f1\fs15\cf0 \{\par
